<title>SPAIN: Spain details April cash budget surplus.</title>
<headline>Spain details April cash budget surplus.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain on Wednesday gave the following breakdown for the April accumulated budget on a cash basis:</p>
<p>						  April 1997  April 1996</p>
<p>   Non-financial revenue (in trillions)    2.01    vs   1.82</p>
<p>   Non-financial expenditure (trillions)   1.60    vs   1.54</p>
<p>   Surplus (in billions)			407.4    vs  279.1</p>
<p>   Accumulated deficit (in billions)	453.8    vs  349.0</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
